					<description>A sanguophage named &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;McLaughlin&lt;/color&gt; is looking for a safe place to meet with 1 other sanguophage where they won't be tracked. Their leader &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;McLaughlin&lt;/color&gt; is asking for you to host the meeting at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Lados&lt;/color&gt;.

