					<cleanupTick>11551090</cleanupTick>
					<initiallyAccepted>True</initiallyAccepted>
					<challengeRating>-1</challengeRating>
					<description>A mechanoid cluster has landed not far from &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Lados&lt;/color&gt;. There's &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;a psychic suppressor machine&lt;/color&gt; there tuned to the female gender and there's a mech cluster.

The mech cluster will remain until you send a team there to attack and destroy it.</description>
