					<initiallyAccepted>True</initiallyAccepted>
					<challengeRating>1</challengeRating>
					<description>You've learned of an ancient complex nearby that is said to contain ancient treasure.

You can break in to collect the loot inside.

Be warned - these kinds of structures can contain a variety of threats. In addition, your activity at the complex might draw unwanted attention.</description>
					<root>OpportunitySite_AncientComplex</root>
					<signalsReceivedDebug IsNull="True" />
