					<description>You've detected an orbiting spacedrone that may contain information about &lt;color=#D9D9BFFF&gt;Axe of Promises&lt;/color&gt;. You have the code that will force it to land at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Lados&lt;/color&gt;.

