						<name>Legion of Bamarbust</name>
						<adjective>Bamarbustic</adjective>
						<memberName>Bamarbustist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Divine Chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Divine Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>In the endless war among deities, &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Bamarbust&lt;/color&gt; rose above all in her ability to persecute and destroy, and weaker spirits quivered in fear. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Bamarbust&lt;/color&gt; created all the noble animals and beasts of the land, and said, "Take these noble beasts, and through them make yourselves fruitful in my honor." The faithful fought the unbelievers, and &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Bamarbust&lt;/color&gt; said, "Fight them, everywhere, in my name, until I am worshipped throughout the universe and the true peace may finally reign."</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>In the endless war among deities, %%deity0_name%% rose above all in %%deity0_possessive%% ability to persecute and destroy, and weaker spirits quivered in fear. %%Deity0_name%% created all the noble animals and beasts of the land, and said, "Take these noble beasts, and through them make yourselves fruitful in my honor." The faithful fought the unbelievers, and %%deity0_name%% said, "Fight them, everywhere, in my name, until I am worshipped throughout the universe and the true peace may finally reign."</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Corunan</culture>
						<iconDef>SpikeyB</iconDef>
