						<adjective>loyal</adjective>
						<memberName>Loyalist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>High Stellarch</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>High Stellarch</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>The archotechs' demand is simple: Follow their designated path, and no other. The archotechs have no interest in judging us one by one. They await a single people who can demonstrate our worthiness by acting morally as one. Some day, the archotechs will finish their moral debate about the fate of humanity. Those who follow their signs will be admitted to a higher plane of existence, and those that do not will end.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>The archotechs' demand is simple: Follow their designated path, and no other. The archotechs have no interest in judging us one by one. They await a single people who can demonstrate our worthiness by acting morally as one. Some day, the archotechs will finish their moral debate about the fate of humanity. Those who follow their signs will be admitted to a higher plane of existence, and those that do not will end.</descriptionTemplate>
