						<name>Great Belief</name>
						<adjective>manporky</adjective>
						<memberName>Manporkist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Moral Thug</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Moral Thug</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Natalie 'Nattie' Davies built an army that spread her power and glory across the land, placing those who refused to follow rightly under her rule. One day while walking the streets, Nattie was surrounded by filthy beggars. She beat them down, taking the money from the weak and worthless that it might be put to good use. To consecrate their commitment, Nattie demanded that believers eat human flesh together at least every week.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Natalie 'Nattie' Davies built an army that spread her power and glory across the land, placing those who refused to follow rightly under her rule. One day while walking the streets, Nattie was surrounded by filthy beggars. She beat them down, taking the money from the weak and worthless that it might be put to good use. To consecrate their commitment, Nattie demanded that believers eat human flesh together at least every week.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Kriminul</culture>
						<iconDef>KnivesDown</iconDef>
						<colorDef>LightMauve</colorDef>
